## Why This Is Asked

Tests knowledge of Strategy pattern and runtime extensibility; expects a minimal interface for a router strategy and a registry that supports hot-loading new strategies. It also probes how the router dispatches to handlers asynchronously and resolves potential conflicts when multiple strategies may apply.

